5.
"Apron" means a defined area, on a land aerodrome, intended to accommodate aircraft for purposes of loading or
unloading passengers, mail or cargo, refuelling, parking or maintenance;

6.
"Air Traffic Service" includes flight information service, alerting service, air traffic advisory service, air traffic control
service, area control service, approach control service and airport control service;

10.
"Manoeuvring Area" means that part of the aerodrome to be used for the take off, landing and taxiing of aircraft,
excluding aprons;

13.
"Movement Area" means that part of an aerodrome to be used for the take off, landing and taxiing of aircraft, consisting
of the manoeuvring area and the apron(s);
